     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I&#39;m trying to wrap my head around shiny to start developing interactive charts and maybe eventually design a dashboard using bootsrap and shiny.<br><br>I&#39;m trying to adapt the telephones by region example to understand the calls to buttons and such. <a href=\"http://shiny.rstudio.com/gallery/telephones-by-region.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shiny.rstudio.com/gallery/telephones-by-region.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792401876709000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1JYXA8HyNSh9XOoGsWkm3C\">Telephones by region</a><br><br>What I&#39;m trying to do is to have two buttons on the left: the first one selects a state, the second one a month.<br>The bar graph to be shown is always the state and country together for comparison. The call with the button for state is something I dont fully understand.<br><br>My data can be in one table or multiple tables, it doesnt matter. Here&#39;s a fictirioius example<br><br>Geography    characteristics    month1    month2<br>Country         Urate                    7            7.5<br>Country         EmpRate               67         68 <br>Country         PartRate                61         62<br>State1           Urate                     8           7.5          <br>State1           EmpRate               65         66<br>State1           PartRate               60          59<br>State2           Urate                    10          9          <br><br>Now, the r code to generate the graphs is not the issue. I work with R but shiny is something new to me.<br><br>Any insights would be greatly appreciated. Below I have included my current code (not properly working bcode in development).<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#800\"># Define the overall UI</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>shinyUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Use a fluid Bootstrap layout</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  fluidPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">    <br>    <br>    </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Give the page a title</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    titlePanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;LFA by State&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    <br>    </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Generate a row with a sidebar</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    sidebarLayout</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">      <br>      <br>      </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Define the sidebar with one input</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      sidebarPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        selectInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Geography&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;State:&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                    choices</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">colnames</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">StateLFA</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        hr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        helpText</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Data from Census 2011&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      </span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      <br>      </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Create a spot for the barplot</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      mainPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        plotOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;LFAPlot&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  <br>      </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      <br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><br>Server:<br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#606\">State</span><span style=\"color:#606\">LFA</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> read</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">csv</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;table.csv&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Define a server for the Shiny app</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>shinyServer</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Fill in the spot we created for a plot</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  output$LFAPlot </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> renderPlot</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    <br>    </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Render a barplot</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    <br>    ggplot</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">ProvLFA</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> aes</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">characteristics</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> y</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">value</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> fill</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Geography</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        geom_bar</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">position </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;dodge&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> stat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;identity&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        theme_classic</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        theme</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">axis</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">text</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> element_text</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">vjust</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> size</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">15</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>            axis</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">text</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">y </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> element_text</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">vjust</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> size</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">15</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        theme</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">panel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">border </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> element_blank</span><span style=\"color:#660\">())</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        theme</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">legend</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">text</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">element_text</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">size</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">16</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        theme</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">legend</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">position</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;bottom&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        theme</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">axis</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">title</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">element_text</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">size</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">15</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        theme</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">plot</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">background</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">element_rect</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fill </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;transparent&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>            colour </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> NA</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        scale_fill_brewer</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">palette</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Paired&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        ylab</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> xlab</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        guides</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fill</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">guide_legend</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">title</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        ggtitle</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;\\n&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        geom_text</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">aes</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">label</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Percent</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> vjust</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> position</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">position_dodge</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">width</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.9</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\">    <br>            <br>        </span><span style=\"color:#800\">#Percent label can be white and inside the bar </span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        </span><span style=\"color:#800\">#geom_text(aes(label=Percent), vjust=1, colour=&quot;white&quot;, </span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>            </span><span style=\"color:#800\">#position=position_dodge(width=0.9))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><br><br><br></div>"
