     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Not sure if I understand what you are looking for…are you looking 2 add two buttons and have some kind of control to your app using the buttons or you want to add something like 2 drop downs where one drop down allows to select the country…the second month? Please clarify..<div><br></div><div>Adding some youtube tutorial videos on shiny in case it helps...</div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL6wLL_RojB5xNOhe2OTSd-DPkMLVY9DfB\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.youtube.com/playlist?list%3DPL6wLL_RojB5xNOhe2OTSd-DPkMLVY9DfB&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792401876715000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2_VMv3yYv10U0MT8pQdRLZ\">http://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL6wLL_RojB5xNOhe2OTSd-DPkMLVY9DfB</a></div></div>"
